text:
The Five Liturgical Confessions


&lt;!-- 1. Flights --&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 1.2rem;"&gt;
  &lt;label style="color: #6dde6d; font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;"&gt;
    1. Recreational Kerosene Combustion (Flights Taken in Past Year)
  &lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #8cb88c; margin-top: 0;"&gt;Every altitude kilometer burned ozone belonging to unborn generations. Return trips double your debt.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;select id="q-flights" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.5rem; background: #050d05; color: #a0cca0; border: 1px solid #2d7a2d; font-family: monospace;"&gt;
    &lt;option value="0"&gt;f0: Zero. My feet have never left the living soil. (+0 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="25"&gt;f1: 1 to 2: A temporary lapse of atmospheric discipline. (-25 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="55"&gt;f2: 3 to 5: Habitual leisure transit. (-55 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="90"&gt;f3: 6 to 10: Chronic airborne defiance. (-90 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="140"&gt;f4: More than 10: I treated the stratosphere as personal exhaust. (-140 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- 2. Car --&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 1.2rem;"&gt;
  &lt;label style="color: #6dde6d; font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;"&gt;
    2. Complicity with the Internal Combustion Engine
  &lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #8cb88c; margin-top: 0;"&gt;The bitumen martyrs tore their skin on the highway to stop this madness. Where were you?&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;select id="q-car" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.5rem; background: #050d05; color: #a0cca0; border: 1px solid #2d7a2d; font-family: monospace;"&gt;
    &lt;option value="0"&gt;c0: I am unmotorized. My transit is biological. (+0 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="20"&gt;c1: I shared or borrowed an engine when biological will failed. (-20 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="50"&gt;c2: I owned a private machine of kinetic vanity. (-50 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="90"&gt;c3: I maintained multiple engines while the ice shelves cracked. (-90 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- 3. Meat --&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 1.2rem;"&gt;
  &lt;label style="color: #6dde6d; font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;"&gt;
    3. Flesh Extraction & Caloric Carnivory
  &lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #8cb88c; margin-top: 0;"&gt;Miniplenty provides algae and pulse paste. How deeply were you attached to animal suffering?&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;select id="q-meat" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.5rem; background: #050d05; color: #a0cca0; border: 1px solid #2d7a2d; font-family: monospace;"&gt;
    &lt;option value="0"&gt;m0: Purely botanical. My teeth are free of blood. (+0 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="20"&gt;m1: Occasional extraction (A few times a month). (-20 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="45"&gt;m2: Weekly animal harvest (A few times a week). (-45 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="75"&gt;m3: Daily flesh ration (Every day). (-75 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="110"&gt;m4: Total caloric carnivory (At every meal). (-110 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- 4. AI --&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 1.2rem;"&gt;
  &lt;label style="color: #6dde6d; font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;"&gt;
    4. Inquiries Directed to the Silicon Mind (Daily AI Compute)
  &lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #8cb88c; margin-top: 0;"&gt;Hyperscale compute drained the rivers before the reactors melted. Every prompt boiled freshwater.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;select id="q-ai" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.5rem; background: #050d05; color: #a0cca0; border: 1px solid #2d7a2d; font-family: monospace;"&gt;
    &lt;option value="0"&gt;a0: Zero. My thoughts are manual, slow, and human. (+0 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="20"&gt;a1: 1 to 5 prompts: A modest theft of river water (a glass per day). (-20 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="45"&gt;a2: 6 to 20 prompts: A commercial drain on the watershed (a bucket). (-45 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="80"&gt;a3: &gt;20 prompts: Continuous algorithmic reliance (a full bath). (-80 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="120"&gt;a4: A synthetic intelligence is calculating this confession right now! (-120 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- 5. Devices --&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"&gt;
  &lt;label style="color: #6dde6d; font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;"&gt;
    5. Parasitic Lithium & Listening Hardware
  &lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #8cb88c; margin-top: 0;"&gt;Every battery required brine evaporation; every sensor transmitted your compliance to corporate servers.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;select id="q-devices" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.5rem; background: #050d05; color: #a0cca0; border: 1px solid #2d7a2d; font-family: monospace;"&gt;
    &lt;option value="10"&gt;d0: 1 or 2: Ascetic survival essentials. (-10 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="30"&gt;d1: 3 to 5: Standard consumer complicity. (-30 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="55"&gt;d2: 6 to 10: Heavy hardware entanglement. (-55 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="90"&gt;d3: More than I can count: Surrounded by glowing screens. (-90 Debt)&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- 6. Sacramental Surrender --&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px dashed #2d7a2d; padding-top: 1rem;"&gt;
  &lt;label style="color: #c8a000; font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;"&gt;
    The Sacramental Surrender: What will you surrender first for the common good?
  &lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;select id="q-surrender" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.5rem; background: #050d05; color: #d4b040; border: 1px solid #8c7010; font-family: monospace;"&gt;
    &lt;option value="surname"&gt;My Surname (Name stricken with chisel marker; designated Citizen [Name]-482)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="opinions"&gt;My Opinions (Passport stamped HERESY RISK; diverted to interrogation)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="weekends"&gt;My Weekends & Leisure (Conscripted into mandatory scullery dishwashing)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="hotwater"&gt;Hot Water & Physical Comfort (Served only chilled biological tea at the bar)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="bedtime"&gt;My Bedtime & Sleep (Conscripted into the 01:00 stationary bike kinetic shift)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="secrets"&gt;My Secrets & Privacy (Issued ACTIVE SURVEILLANCE card; monitored by cameras)&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;button type="button" onclick="calculateDebt()" style="background: #1a5c1a; color: #fff; border: 1px solid #4aad4a; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-family: 'Special Elite', monospace; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer; letter-spacing: 0.1em; width: 100%;"&gt;
  CALCULATE STARTING DEBT & GENERATE PASSPORT
&lt;/button&gt;





&lt;div class="permit-header" style="color: #6dde6d;"&gt;
  R.E.I.G.N. CITIZEN PASSPORT BOOKLET&lt;br&gt;
  Sanctuary De Warren · Intake Accounting
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="permit-field"&gt;
  &lt;span class="label"&gt;Initial Biological Debt&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="value" style="color: #ff6666;"&gt;-100 Carbon Credits (Gestational Base)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="permit-field"&gt;
  &lt;span class="label"&gt;Confession Score Penalty&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="value" id="res-penalty" style="color: #ff8888;"&gt;-185 Credits&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="permit-field" style="border-top: 1px solid #2d7a2d; padding-top: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;"&gt;
  &lt;span class="label" style="font-weight: bold; color: #6dde6d;"&gt;STARTING DEBT BALANCE&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="value" id="res-total" style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold; color: #ff4444;"&gt;-285 Carbon Credits&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="permit-field"&gt;
  &lt;span class="label"&gt;Sacramental Surrender&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="value" id="res-surrender" style="color: #c8a000;"&gt;My Surname&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="permit-field"&gt;
  &lt;span class="label"&gt;Status&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="value" style="color: #e0a020;"&gt;INDEBTED CITIZEN (REPORT TO GARAGE FOR REHABILITATION)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #8cb88c; border-top: 1px dashed #1a3a1a; padding-top: 0.7rem; font-style: italic;"&gt;
  Present this balance at the Garage Intake Checkpoint at De Warren on November 28. Work down your debt through ministry quests and silly carbon-reduction tasks to unlock full citizenship and the VIP Scotch Library.
&lt;/div&gt;
